  "llms": {
    "intro": "# ToolsBuilt\n\n> Free, fast, private online calculators and productivity utilities that run entirely in your web browser.\n\nToolsBuilt provides focused, single-purpose calculation and conversion tools with no signups, no paywalls, and no server-side data processing. All user inputs stay 100% private inside the client's browser.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- **Client-Side Processing**: Every calculation and conversion runs locally in JavaScript. No form inputs or sensitive data are ever sent to a server.\n- **Privacy by Design**: No account creation. Calculations run in the browser and inputs are not sent to a server. Anonymous traffic statistics are collected with Google Analytics.\n- **Fast & Accessible**: Lightweight vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript with instant feedback, keyboard navigation, and responsive mobile-first layouts.\n- **Free Forever**: All tools are completely free to use without restrictions.\n\n",
    "categories": "Tool Categories",
    "tools": "Available Tools",
    "blog": "Blog & Guides",
    "links": "## Additional Links\n\n- All Tools Directory: https://toolsbuilt.com/tools/\n- Blog: https://toolsbuilt.com/blog/\n- Website: https://toolsbuilt.com/\n- Atom Feed: https://toolsbuilt.com/feed.xml\n"
  },
